Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.86,0:00:06.89,C,,0,0,0,,Potter, don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:08.01,C,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.55,C,,0,0,0,,Only at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:11.29,C,,0,0,0,,And walk over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.37,C,,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.94,C,,0,0,0,,Dance with me right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:16.51,C,,0,0,0,,now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:17.92,C,,0,0,0,,The floor won't touch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:18.91,C,,0,0,0,,us while we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.44,C,,0,0,0,,You may scream at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.32,C,,0,0,0,,me the moment we're
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:21.91,C,,0,0,0,,alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:24.15,C,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'm dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:24.98,C,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.94,C,,0,0,0,,those things are and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:26.70,C,,0,0,0,,why they want me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:27.09,C,,0,0,0,,to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:30.17,C,,0,0,0,,It's a long story,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:31.24,C,,0,0,0,,and it ends with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:32.27,C,,0,0,0,,you breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:34.23,C,,0,0,0,,Eyes on the ceiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:34.71,C,,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:36.11,C,,0,0,0,,Not on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.10,C,,0,0,0,,The arrows land on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.51,C,,0,0,0,,the orchestra's offbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:39.84,C,,0,0,0,,Change your step with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:40.52,C,,0,0,0,,me, half a beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.73,C,,0,0,0,,late, on my count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:45.31,C,,0,0,0,,You counted,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:46.41,C,,0,0,0,,clever boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:48.25,C,,0,0,0,,Then count faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:49.52,C,,0,0,0,,The music won't slow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:50.55,C,,0,0,0,,down for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:52.31,C,,0,0,0,,Show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.54,0:00:53.98,C,,0,0,0,,Even you can't cut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.98,0:00:54.89,C,,0,0,0,,all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:00:59.73,C,,0,0,0,,Efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:00.96,C,,0,0,0,,Remind me to applaud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.08,C,,0,0,0,,once the orchestra gives
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:03.15,C,,0,0,0,,me my hand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.36,C,,0,0,0,,I meant to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:05.81,C,,0,0,0,,that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:07.08,C,,0,0,0,,The trolley was always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.08,0:01:08.19,C,,0,0,0,,part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:10.19,C,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:10.86,C,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the catch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.86,0:01:11.41,C,,0,0,0,,anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.38,C,,0,0,0,,He's using the waltz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:13.83,C,,0,0,0,,grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:15.90,C,,0,0,0,,Every proper step we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:17.42,C,,0,0,0,,dance together seals another
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:18.11,C,,0,0,0,,door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:19.88,C,,0,0,0,,Then we dance it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.87,C,,0,0,0,,wrong on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:22.74,C,,0,0,0,,Break the grid with
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:23.19,C,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.84,0:01:25.31,C,,0,0,0,,That was your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:26.52,C,,0,0,0,,Drop the ceiling on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.52,0:01:27.75,C,,0,0,0,,the whole hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:29.89,C,,0,0,0,,Left side,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:30.61,C,,0,0,0,,three beats,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:31.61,C,,0,0,0,,the red table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:32.48,C,,0,0,0,,Flip it on my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:33.34,C,,0,0,0,,mark and hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.01,C,,0,0,0,,over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:39.30,C,,0,0,0,,Harry, it has our
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.01,C,,0,0,0,,names.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.78,0:01:42.16,C,,0,0,0,,Both of them burned
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:43.25,C,,0,0,0,,right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.84,C,,0,0,0,,Draconia, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:45.65,C,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.28,C,,0,0,0,,I spent weeks trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:49.31,C,,0,0,0,,to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:51.41,C,,0,0,0,,You never once listened.
